### Authentication API Test Examples
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@accessToken = your-access-token-here
@refreshToken = your-refresh-token-here

### 1. Register a new user with username
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPassword123!",
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "username": "johndoe",
  "phone": "+1234567890"
}

###

### 2. Register a new user without username
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jane.smith@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPassword123!",
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "phone": "+9876543210"
}

###

### 3. Login with email
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPassword123!"
}

###

### 4. Login with username
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "johndoe",
  "password": "StrongPassword123!"
}

###

### 5. Get current user profile (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 6. Refresh access token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###

### 7. Forgot Password with email
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com"
}

###

### 8. Forgot Password with username
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "johndoe"
}

###

### 9. Reset Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password?token=your-reset-token-here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newPassword": "NewStrongPassword123!",
  "confirmPassword": "NewStrongPassword123!"
}

###

### 10. Get all users (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 11. Get user by ID (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 12. Create user (Protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user3@example.com",
  "firstName": "User",
  "lastName": "Three",
  "phone": "+1111111111"
}

###

### 13. Update user (Protected)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane Updated",
  "lastName": "Smith Updated"
}

###

### 14. Delete user (Protected)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 15. Tutor Onboarding
POST {{baseUrl}}/onboarding/tutor
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "John Smith",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-01",
  "subjects": "Mathematics, Physics",
  "gradeLevels": "High School, College",
  "yearsOfExperience": 5,
  "teachingPhilosophy": "I believe in hands-on learning and practical applications of theoretical concepts.",
  "cv": "",
  "introVideo": "",
  "interviewTime": "2023-12-01T10:00:00Z",
  "govId": ""
}

###

### 16. Upload Tutor File
POST {{baseUrl}}/onboarding/tutor/1/file
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cv.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./samples/cv.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fileType"

cv
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--